{"beat_id": "S017_B091", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "I was told we had a custody problem.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B013 — Mirena arrives for formal review", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA", "staging": "Crown Princess Mirena Ceryth enters without ceremonial procession. The officer bows; the party follows appropriately. Mirena looks at the open writ."}},
