{"beat_id": "S017_B120", "speaker_id": "maevra", "text": "I can trace what exists.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B017 — Maevra's authority", "source_speaker_label": "MAEVRA", "staging": "Maevra corrects herself."}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B121", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "Do that.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B017 — Maevra's authority", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B122", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "We're going with her.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B017 — Maevra's authority", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B123", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "You are contained, not decorative.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B017 — Maevra's authority", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA", "staging": "Not a question. Mirena looks at him."}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B124", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Good distinction.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B017 — Maevra's authority", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B125", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "One more.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B018 — Ilyra's final condition", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B126", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "Go ahead.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B018 — Ilyra's final condition", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B127", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "If following this chain puts us outside the authorized district?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B018 — Ilyra's final condition", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B128", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "Issue an investigative movement writ under my authority.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B018 — Ilyra's final condition", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA", "staging": "Mirena considers it."}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B129", "speaker_id": "maevra", "text": "Limited purpose.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B018 — Ilyra's final condition", "source_speaker_label": "MAEVRA"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B130", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "Obviously.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B018 — Ilyra's final condition", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B131", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "Don't look so surprised, Commander.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B018 — Ilyra's final condition", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA", "staging": "Maevra gives her the smallest approving look. Mirena catches it."}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B132", "speaker_id": "maevra", "text": "I wasn't.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B018 — Ilyra's final condition", "source_speaker_label": "MAEVRA"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B133", "speaker_id": "mirena", "text": "Of course not.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B018 — Ilyra's final condition", "source_speaker_label": "MIRENA"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B134", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "That one have a beginning?", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B019 — New writ", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS", "staging": "The new writ is sealed. Maevra checks it before anyone moves."}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B135", "speaker_id": "maevra", "text": "Yes.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B019 — New writ", "source_speaker_label": "MAEVRA"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B136", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Promising.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B019 — New writ", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B137", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Low standard.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B019 — New writ", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B138", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Bad day for standards.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B019 — New writ", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B139", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Please don't make that our motto.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B019 — New writ", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B140", "speaker_id": "maevra", "text": "If the process is compromised—", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B020 — Exit", "source_speaker_label": "MAEVRA", "staging": "The group heads toward the Judicial Causeway. Behind them, Caelora keeps functioning: people work, carts move, guards change shifts. The system appears legitimate, everyone involved is behaving reasonably, and the order still has no lawful beginning."}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B141", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "Then we find out.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B020 — Exit", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS"}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B142", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "Food before constitutional crisis.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S017_B020 — Exit", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN", "staging": "Torren glances toward a food stall they are passing."}},
{"beat_id": "S017_B143", "speaker_id": "ilyra", "text": "Finally, a policy I support.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE", "RETURN_PLAYER_CONTROL"], "source_section": "S017_B020 — Exit", "source_speaker_label": "ILYRA", "staging_after": "Cut to player control / S018 route."}}
